{
  "name": "mesmerize",
  "description": "Mesmerize is a GPGPU compute framework written in Rust that utilizes Vulkano to orchestrate real-time stochastic simulations. It abstracts the complexity of Vulkan pipeline state management, including descriptor set layouts and command buffer recording, to execute GLSL-based 'scramble' and 'drift' kernels. The application integrates with Winit for windowing and event handling, providing a high-performance environment for visualizing discrete state evolutions on the GPU.",
